e the Black Eagle looking around because of this were bat nonsense. Or even them being used as a catspaw by the shadow lords to check this shit out. With plausible deniability","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 04-21-2021, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T15:05:35-07:00","id":1445133,"title":"","content":"have allready h ad a prophetic dream of bewaring the misguided gaian<br /> they mean well but think you are a monster that must be destroyed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-21T15:21:28-07:00","id":1445139,"title":"","content":"Misguided servants of Gaia is a very large category and an almost infinite number of things could fit there. However, if the first reborn Camazotz is receiving prophetic dreams about it, it goes to reason this is something especially appropriate for a werebat. Maybe because of the history of the breed; or the nature of Bat; or its form or abilities of the breed.<br /> <br /> As suggested, the Shadow Lords who seek to redeem Bat could be a great choice. Maybe they are just going about it the wrong way, and the PC has the opportunity to join them and help them in their quest. Or some other involvement with them.<br /> <br /> Another idea is that a Garou pack will soon attack and wipe out a pack of Black Spiral Dancers with the Bat totem (or hive with a caern totem of Bat!), but there is a newly changed Garou who hasn't undergone the transmogrification rites, and that Garou has an important destiny. The Gaian Garou attacking need to kill the BSDs so that Garou is not corrupted, but they aren't supposed to kill the Garou but which would happen in the normal course of events. The PC now needs to go in save that Garou, and help her fulfill her destiny. But of course that pack of Gaian Garou will simply see some corrupt werebat/bat fomori rescue a BSD from justice and hunt them down. They're not going to believe any obviously phoney story about how this bat creature is actually a good guy or that this BSD child has some important destiny. The chronicle becomes about this child's personal journey and the PC as her protector and mentor.<br /> <br /> Another possibility is that the misguided Gaians are about to repeat the tragedy of destroying the Camazotz. They are going to kill a group of people who will be needed down the line. This isn't about an individual, but the survival of the group. Maybe its own of the surviving Changing Breeds that is down to their last members and kinfolk, but won't be recognized as such. Maybe it's something like one of the Mockery Breeds that will be essential to something. Maybe its a group of humans about to discover something important or who are custodians of some lost lore. Maybe it's a group of rare animals that will go extinct, but will be easily overlooked by a group of rampaging Garou (like a particular species of frog). As an unforeseen survivor of extinction, the PC has been chosen to do this. He just needs to figure out the clues first.<br /> <br /> Maybe there is some ancient cave structure that was once holy to the Camazotz thousands of years ago. There are certain taboos, wards, etc. that if violated will lead to very bad things. Well, there is a pack of Garou who only have a partial knowledge of it and are trying to find it and raid it. But in doing so, they'll cause something bad to happen. The PC is the only person who could learn this knowledge from his Ancestors and knows what must be prevented. He just has to figure out how to first identify this pack and then get them to understand without being killed by them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-22T22:27:45-07:00","id":1445429,"title":"","content":"the reborn Camazotz in question is hosted by a Shadow Lord child of bat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"im